<p:sld xmlns:a="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/drawingml/2006/main" xmlns:r="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/relationships" xmlns:p="http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/presentationml/2006/main"><p:cSld name="Slide 10"><p:spTree><p:nvGrpSpPr><p:cNvPr id="1" name=""/><p:cNvGrpSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvGrpSpPr><p:grpSpPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="0" y="0"/><a:ext cx="0" cy="0"/><a:chOff x="0" y="0"/><a:chExt cx="0" cy="0"/></a:xfrm></p:grpSpPr><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="2" name="Text 0"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="502920"/><a:ext cx="10789920" cy="237744"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="8A929B"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Rotex Automation  ·  Google Ads and Meta  ·  ₹12.9 lakh  ·  7 months</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1000" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="3" name="Text 1"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="914400"/><a:ext cx="8229600" cy="914400"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="3200"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="2500" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2B3138"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Georgia" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Georgia" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Georgia" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Two channels doing two different jobs</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="2500" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="4" name="Text 2"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="1874520"/><a:ext cx="9692640" cy="822960"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1863"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1150" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="555D66"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Rotex manufactures solenoid valves for industrial process automation. Lead flow swung from week to week with no reliable base, and quality was thin. Generic valve searches pull in students, job seekers and repair enquiries alongside real buyers, so sales could not plan against the pipeline.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1150" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="5" name="Shape 3"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="2926080"/><a:ext cx="10735056" cy="8230"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E4E7EA"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="12700"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E4E7EA"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="6" name="Text 4"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="3154680"/><a:ext cx="4937760" cy="256032"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1150" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2B3138"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Google, for buyers already searching</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1150" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="7" name="Text 5"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="713232" y="3474720"/><a:ext cx="4937760" cy="2011680"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1782"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="555D66"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Split campaigns by intent. Supplier and manufacturer terms apart from product specification terms, and international apart from domestic, so the two markets stopped bidding against each other.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1782"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1782"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="555D66"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Rewrote the ads around what costs a buyer money: delivery delays on custom valves, missing SIL3 upgrade, paying a premium for nothing. Added a selection guide for buyers still specifying.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="8" name="Shape 6"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="5989320" y="3154680"/><a:ext cx="8230" cy="2377440"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E4E7EA"/></a:solidFill><a:ln w="12700"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="E4E7EA"/></a:solidFill><a:prstDash val="solid"/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="9" name="Text 7"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6537960" y="3154680"/><a:ext cx="4937760" cy="256032"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1150" b="1" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2B3138"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Meta, for reaching the right industries</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1150" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="10" name="Text 8"/><p:cNvSpPr/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="6537960" y="3474720"/><a:ext cx="4937760" cy="2011680"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" lIns="0" tIns="0" rIns="0" bIns="0" rtlCol="0" anchor="ctr"/><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1782"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="555D66"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Targeted by job function, field of study and industry, so ads reached people whose work actually involves specifying valves rather than anyone who once liked a machinery page.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1782"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/></a:p><a:p><a:pPr marL="0" indent="0"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPts val="1782"/></a:lnSpc><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="555D66"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="0"/><a:ea typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="Arial" pitchFamily="34" charset="-120"/></a:rPr><a:t>Split domestic from international with different formats, and tightened the lead form to capture company, industry and application so sales knew what the call was about.</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" sz="1100" dirty="0"/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>